@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@jobId = bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb
@calculationId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/health

### Calculate: min -50000.00, first gap 2026-10-29, T+30 0.00, risk null
POST {{base}}/internal/v1/forecast/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{jobId}}
X-Job-Id: {{jobId}}
X-Calculation-Id: {{calculationId}}

< ../src/test/resources/fixtures/calculate.json

### Backtest: MAE 31000.00, COMPLETE, 30 horizon metrics
POST {{base}}/internal/v1/forecast/backtest
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{jobId}}
X-Job-Id: {{jobId}}
X-Calculation-Id: {{calculationId}}

< ../src/test/resources/fixtures/backtest.json

### Daily payments are not automatically recurring: patterns=[]
POST {{base}}/internal/v1/forecast/recurring-detection
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{jobId}}
X-Job-Id: {{jobId}}
X-Calculation-Id: {{calculationId}}

< ../src/test/resources/fixtures/recurring-detection.json
